# tools_line.uis -- Linie / Kurve (agent T4): a drag draws a live line (preview only, the
# layer unchanged until Fertigstellen), Esc = no history step, Enter = one step, the control
# points bend it (spline through the points, right button = Bézier), the move handle moves
# it, Linienart (dashes), Linienende (filled arrow), right button = secondary colour,
# Überschreiben with a transparent colour, the selection clip (test rectangle), Strg+Z drops
# a live line, a tool switch commits.  Antialiasing off (aliased = pixel centres, ties to
# +x / +y) so the pixels are exact.
# Mapping (1280 x 800, zoom 100 %): image pixel (x, y) at (240 + x, 148 + y); the pointer
# is at the pixel centre (x + 0.5, y + 0.5).
# Probes: 900 composite / 901 layer pixel (x | y << 16) -> #9900; #9930 edit pending,
# #9935 history entries; #524544 line state "L S|B x0,y0 x1,y1 x2,y2 x3,y3" (rounded).
size 1280 800
theme light
key o
expect #9931 value 17
cmd 930 400
cmd 932 0
expect #9935 value 1

# ------------------------------------------------------------ a straight line, Esc drops it
drag 290,248 490,248
expect #9930 value 1
expect #524544 text "L S 50,100 117,100 184,100 250,100"
cmd 900 6553750
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 901 6553750
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
# 4 px: rows 99..102, columns 51..250
cmd 900 6422678
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
cmd 900 6684822
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 900 6750358
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
cmd 900 6553650
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
cmd 900 6553651
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 900 6553850
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 900 6553851
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
key esc
expect #9930 value 0
cmd 900 6553750
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
expect #9935 value 1

# ------------------------------------------------------------ curve: spline, Bézier, move
drag 290,248 490,248
drag 357,248 357,298
expect #524544 text "L S 50,100 118,150 184,100 250,100"
cmd 900 9830517
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
drag 424,248 424,198 right
expect #524544 text "L B 50,100 118,150 184,50 250,100"
# the move handle after the end (22 DIP along P0 -> P3)
drag 512,248 522,268
expect #524544 text "L B 60,120 128,170 194,70 260,120"
expect #9935 value 1
key enter
expect #9930 value 0
expect #9935 value 2
expect #524544 text ""
key ctrl+z
expect #9935 value 2
cmd 901 11141248
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
key ctrl+y

# ------------------------------------------------------------ Striche (3 1 x width)
cmd 795 65537
expect #524547 text "1,0,0,0,20,0"
drag 290,448 490,448
cmd 900 19660860
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 900 19660864
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
cmd 900 19660870
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
key enter
cmd 795 65536

# ------------------------------------------------------------ filled arrow at the end
cmd 795 196610
drag 290,548 490,548
cmd 900 26476784
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 900 26607856
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
key enter
cmd 795 196608
expect #9935 value 4

# ------------------------------------------------------------ right button: secondary
cmd 944 3
drag 290,648 490,648 right
cmd 900 32768150
expect #9900 text "FF0000FF"
key enter
cmd 944 5

# ------------------------------------------------------------ Überschreiben, 50 % red
cmd 943 4
cmd 933 14
drag 290,698 490,698
key enter
cmd 901 36044950
expect #9900 text "80FF0000"
cmd 933 0
cmd 943 6
expect #9935 value 6

# ------------------------------------------------------------ selection clip [0,150) x [570,590)
cmd 941 37355520
cmd 942 38666390
drag 290,728 490,728
cmd 900 38010980
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 900 38011080
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"
key enter
cmd 941 0
cmd 942 0
cmd 901 38010980
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
cmd 901 38011080
expect #9900 text "FFFFFFFF"

# ------------------------------------------------------------ Strg+Z drops, tool switch commits
drag 290,348 490,348
expect #9930 value 1
key ctrl+z
expect #9930 value 0
expect #9935 value 7
drag 290,348 490,348
key b
expect #9930 value 0
expect #9935 value 8
cmd 901 13107350
expect #9900 text "FF000000"
